{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生の稲熊ひな（いなぐまひな）です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobJvaj6O.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobP8qJfr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日のオンラインミート＆グリートで、ういたんとお揃いのパジャマを着ました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🦦×🐻‍❄️️\nひんやり動物さん達"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実は、パジャマミーグリこっそり憧れていたのです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "着れて嬉しかった〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パジャマのおかげで、修学旅行の夜みたいにゆるい空気感でたくさんお話できました🌙*ﾟ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんの新しい1面を知れて、距離が縮まったような気がして嬉しいんだ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これに味をしめて、15th Single期間のミーグリは毎回パジャマで現れるかもしれません〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "14th Single期間のミート＆グリート、すごく楽しかったです。\n特別な時間でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今作の期間もよろしくお願いします🧸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お知らせ⋆͛📢⋆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月27日発売「MARQUEE」vol.162"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ももちゃんと表紙を務めさせていただきました〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobizh1ek.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob5XeuS2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すっごく久しぶりに制服を着ました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "せっかくの制服なので、普段とは違う方法で自撮りをしようと思って試行錯誤した結果です！\n口が半開き！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7TJeyZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色鮮やかで春らしい服も着せていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "個人的に、ももちゃんの表情がすごく好きなんです！\n普段はクールで、目力のあるかっこいい表情を見せてくれることが多いんだけど、\n今回は春らしいお洋服の雰囲気もあってか、ふわっとした、やわらかい可愛らしい表情もたくさん見られて、とっても可愛かったです🌷🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日、SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんにお邪魔した際に、パネルの横に雑誌も並べてくださっていてとっても嬉しかったな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きらさんと大園さんに見てください！って紹介して、\n沢山褒めて貰ったよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非チェックしてみてください〜\n感想お待ちしております🔎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくれてありがとう。\nまたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おやすみなさい！"}], "source": "official"}